      },
      "message": "feat(machines): Sodick ALC400G wire EDM machine file with sourced travels\n\nX 400, Y 300, U 150, V 150 mm and taper 25 deg from Sodick's published\nALC series specifications. Guide heights, AWT and conditions have no\npublic source and are left out; the app refuses a cut until the user\nstates a condition.\n\nFixes #1501\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
